<title>FRANCE: PRESS DIGEST - France - No papers on April 10.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - France - No papers on April 10.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Due to a strike by printers' unions there are no French newspapers on Thursday.</p>
